%%{init: {"theme": "neutral"} }%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor O as Operator
    participant C as Console (apps/console)
    participant A as apps/api
    participant T as Train service
    participant Q as Qore Catalog API

    Note over O,Q: PLANNED — not built yet. Storage, model format and job queue are open questions.
    O->>C: upload product images
    C->>A: create dataset + image records
    O->>C: link images to catalog products
    C->>A: search products
    A->>Q: GET /v1/... (x-api-key)
    Q-->>A: products
    O->>C: start training run
    C->>A: create training run
    A->>T: enqueue job
    T->>Q: fetch product metadata
    T->>T: train / distill model
    T-->>A: run status + metrics + artifact
    A-->>C: run complete
